  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPractice Management \n\t\tPractice Management Help Guide\n\n### Create Sender ID - SMS\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 4 Apr, 2023 at 11:00 AM\n\n\t\t According to our SMS provider,  they have recently changed their SMS policy.  If you would like to send a SMS, with a  new sender ID, you you must register here. https://senderid.burstsms.com/?country=United+Kingdom&account=78981.\n\nAlternatively you can use the registered sender id of 'Capium' then the  SMS will send.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
